description.en:
Spididol 600 Granules Is A Non-Steroidal Anti-Inflammatory Drug With Analgesic, Antipyretic And Anti-Rheumatic Properties.
Used To Treat The Following Painful And Inflammatory Diseases:
• Different Conditions Of Chronic Pain 
• Acute Disease, Such As Symptoms Of Cervical Syndrome, Headache, Toothache, Muscular And Ostearticular Pain, Painful Spine Syndrome, Post-Traumatic And Postoperative Inflammation And Pain; 
• Conditions Of Gynecological Pain, Such As Dysmenorrhea;
• Recurring Intermittent Pain In Rheumatic Diseases, Flammable And Degenerative Forms And Morning Joint Stiffness; 
• Extra-Articular Rheumatism;
• Fever And Pain In Infectious Diseases (Eg. Common Cold).
The Effect Occurs After About 30 Minutes.
Active Ingredient
• Ibuprofen (600 Mg ) L-Arginine(600 Mg)
Dose: The Single Dose Is Usually 400-600 Mg (Maximum 800 Mg).
The Average Daily Dose Is 1200-1800 Mg.Spididol Is Not Suitable For Children Up To 12 Years.
